  "answer_markdown": "Over the 30-day window, 2 devices are steadily losing disk space: 8NM23J95R5I6 (acme-thinkpad-8) and MT7PJB7N5LRE (acme-macbook-4). Both devices currently have critically low disk free space below the 15.0% threshold.\n\n- Device 8NM23J95R5I6 (acme-thinkpad-8) declined from 17.27% free disk space on 2026-05-14 to 14.74% on 2026-05-19, reaching a latest reading of 2.59% on 2026-06-12 [E1, E2, E3]. [E1][E2][E3]\n- Device MT7PJB7N5LRE (acme-macbook-4) dropped from 7.18% free disk space on 2026-05-14 to 2.0% on 2026-06-12 [E4, E5]. [E4][E5]\n\n**Caveats & scope:**\n- Telemetry as of 2026-06-12T11:00:00+00:00.\n- Policy thresholds applied: low_disk_free_pct = 15.0% (global), disk_burn_min_slope_pct_per_day = 0.1%/day (global), disk_trend_min_r2 = 0.8 (global).\n- Trend evaluation covered 10 devices across the 30-day window, identifying 2 matching devices.\n- For MT7PJB7N5LRE, values have flattened near 2.0%, so linear days-to-zero projection may overstate depletion rate.\n\n**Evidence:**\n- `[E1]` `snap_e0918c3d573c39f9` · `8NM23J95R5I6` (acme-thinkpad-8) · First window disk free: 17.27% · 2026-05-14T10:10:00\n- `[E2]` `snap_45a85d31732f0351` · `8NM23J95R5I6` (acme-thinkpad-8) · First reading below 15.0% threshold: 14.74% · 2026-05-19T08:42:00\n- `[E3]` `snap_e1d70fe2e26e48da` · `8NM23J95R5I6` (acme-thinkpad-8) · Latest disk free: 2.59% · 2026-06-12T09:02:00\n- `[E4]` `snap_b996cebe5fbdb8de` · `MT7PJB7N5LRE` (acme-macbook-4) · First window disk free: 7.18% · 2026-05-14T11:14:00\n- `[E5]` `snap_de2da5a8a102d45b` · `MT7PJB7N5LRE` (acme-macbook-4) · Latest disk free: 2.0% · 2026-06-12T08:39:00",
